{%- comment -%}
  theinmag-creativity-tiles
  The three "keep the creativity going" tiles (competitions / live gallery /
  membership), lifted VERBATIM from sections/theinmag-submitted.liquid so they
  render pixel-identical wherever they are dropped. Ported here as a shared
  snippet so a page can carry the exact submitted tiles without the submitted
  section being present, and without ever editing that section.

  Ported faithfully:
    - the submitted tiles markup, class names kept as theinmag-submitted__* so
      the look is identical (this snippet is never rendered on /pages/submitted,
      so there is no double-definition anywhere),
    - the submitted tile CSS (Beat 2), inlined below,
    - a self-contained gallery fetch, scoped to data-theinmag-ctiles-* hooks so
      it shares nothing with the submitted section's own script.

  Requirements of the host page:
    - render {% render 'theinmag-character-pool' %} once (for the membership
      mINion slot),
    - be included with {% include 'theinmag-creativity-tiles' %} so it inherits
      the section scope (it reads section.settings.* and, via the include of
      theinmag-competitions-data just below, the comp_* arrays).

  Settings read (add these to the host section schema if missing):
    comps_name, comps_link, comps_count,
    gallery_name, gallery_link, gallery_count, gallery_feed_url,
    membership_name, membership_link, membership_headline,
    membership_image (+ _fallback, _alt), membership_hover (+ _fallback),
    membership_feature_1..4, membership_review_count.

  No em dashes anywhere (hyphens only). "creation" not "work".
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} Parallel comp arrays (comp_names, comp_logos, comp_when_text, comp_tile_states ...) for the competitions tile. Same include the competitions and submitted pages use. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- include 'theinmag-competitions-data' -%}

<div class="theinmag-submitted__tiles">

  {%- comment -%} COMPETITIONS tile - bright like /pages/competitions, sharing the current live comps {%- endcomment -%}
  <a class="theinmag-submitted__ptile theinmag-submitted__ptile--comps" href="{{ section.settings.comps_link }}">
    <span class="theinmag-submitted__ptile-bar theinmag-submitted__ptile-bar--comps">
      <span class="theinmag-submitted__ptile-barname">{{ section.settings.comps_name }}</span>
      <span class="theinmag-submitted__ptile-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </span>
    </span>
    {%- comment -%}
      Build the shown set at RENDER time. Two jobs:

      1) Live / expiry guard, copied from sections/theinmag-competitions.liquid.
         comp_tile_states is baked at BUILD time, so a comp that closed since the
         last push could keep reading "live now". comp_expiry_dates carries each
         row's real ISO close ('' for perennial / TBC rows). We compare it to the
         render date (midnight to midnight, so a comp closing today is still open
         all day) and downgrade any passed close to annual-again, which drops it
         out of the live set below. Only the damaging direction is handled, same
         as the hub page.

      2) Order: soonest real closing date first, with perennial rows (Rolling /
         Year-round / Quarterly, i.e. no ISO close) last. For every still-live
         comp we build a sort key "<iso-close-or-9999-sentinel>~<padded-index>",
         sort those as plain strings (ISO dates sort correctly that way, the 9999
         sentinel sorts last, ties fall back to data order), then read back the
         first comps_count indexes. Nothing is hardcoded, so the set self-freshens
         each day.

      Missing or broken logos never leave a broken box: an absent asset skips the
      logo slot in Liquid, and the onerror handler removes the slot if the image
      itself fails to load, so the row falls back cleanly to the name.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- liquid
      assign comps_count = section.settings.comps_count | default: 6
      if comps_count < 6
        assign comps_count = 6
      endif
      if comps_count > 8
        assign comps_count = 8
      endif

      assign comps_today_stamp = 'now' | date: '%Y-%m-%d' | date: '%s' | times: 1
      assign comps_sort_str = ''
      for cid in comp_ids
        assign cci = forloop.index0
        assign cc_state = comp_tile_states[cci]
        assign cc_expiry = comp_expiry_dates[cci]
        if cc_expiry != blank and cc_state != 'annual-again'
          assign cc_expiry_stamp = cc_expiry | date: '%s' | times: 1
          if cc_expiry_stamp < comps_today_stamp
            assign cc_state = 'annual-again'
          endif
        endif
        if cc_state == 'live-now'
          assign cc_key = cc_expiry
          assign cc_year = cc_expiry | slice: 0, 2
          if cc_expiry == blank or cc_year != '20' or cc_expiry.size != 10
            assign cc_key = '9999-99-99'
          endif
          assign cc_idx_pad = cci
          if cci < 10
            assign cc_idx_pad = '0' | append: cci
          endif
          assign comps_sort_str = comps_sort_str | append: cc_key | append: '~' | append: cc_idx_pad | append: ','
        endif
      endfor
      assign comps_sorted = comps_sort_str | split: ',' | sort
    -%}
    <span class="theinmag-submitted__ptile-feed theinmag-submitted__ptile-feed--comps">
      {%- assign comps_shown = 0 -%}
      {%- for comps_entry in comps_sorted -%}
        {%- if comps_shown >= comps_count -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
        {%- assign ci = comps_entry | split: '~' | last | plus: 0 -%}
        {%- assign clogo = comp_logos[ci] -%}
        {%- assign cc_slug = comp_cost_slugs[ci] -%}
        <span class="theinmag-submitted__ccard">
          {%- comment -%} TOP: small logo left of the competition name {%- endcomment -%}
          <span class="theinmag-submitted__ccard-top">
            {%- if clogo != blank -%}
              <span class="theinmag-submitted__ccard-logo">
                <img src="{{ clogo | asset_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy" onerror="this.closest('.theinmag-submitted__ccard-logo').remove()">
              </span>
            {%- endif -%}
            <span class="theinmag-submitted__ccard-name">{{ comp_names[ci] }}</span>
          </span>
          {%- comment -%} MIDDLE: plain, factual description, wraps freely (no clamp) {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- if comp_descriptions[ci] != blank -%}
            <span class="theinmag-submitted__ccard-desc">{{ comp_descriptions[ci] }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- comment -%} BOTTOM: live badge (guarded) + deadline + cost, then eligibility {%- endcomment -%}
          <span class="theinmag-submitted__ccard-foot">
            <span class="theinmag-submitted__ccard-status">
              <span class="theinmag-submitted__clive"><span class="theinmag-submitted__clive-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>live now</span>
              {%- if comp_meta_lines[ci] != blank -%}<span class="theinmag-submitted__ccard-deadline">{{ comp_meta_lines[ci] }}</span>{%- endif -%}
              {%- if cc_slug == 'free' -%}<span class="theinmag-submitted__ccard-cost theinmag-submitted__ccard-cost--free">free</span>{%- elsif cc_slug == 'paid' -%}<span class="theinmag-submitted__ccard-cost theinmag-submitted__ccard-cost--paid">paid</span>{%- endif -%}
            </span>
            {%- if comp_whos[ci] != blank -%}<span class="theinmag-submitted__ccard-who">{{ comp_whos[ci] }}</span>{%- endif -%}
          </span>
        </span>
        {%- assign comps_shown = comps_shown | plus: 1 -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </span>
    <span class="theinmag-submitted__ptile-fade theinmag-submitted__ptile-fade--comps" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </a>

  {%- comment -%} GALLERY tile - mirrors the mobile gallery: a single column of live submissions, each with its real attribution, under a simple "Live gallery" bar {%- endcomment -%}
  <a
    class="theinmag-submitted__ptile theinmag-submitted__ptile--gallery"
    href="{{ section.settings.gallery_link }}"
    data-theinmag-ctiles-gallery
    data-gallery-json="{{ section.settings.gallery_feed_url }}"
    data-gallery-json-fallback="{{ 'gallery-data.json' | asset_url }}"
    data-gallery-count="{{ section.settings.gallery_count }}"
  >
    <span class="theinmag-submitted__ptile-bar">
      <span class="theinmag-submitted__ptile-barname">{{ section.settings.gallery_name }}</span>
      <span class="theinmag-submitted__ptile-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </span>
    </span>
    <span class="theinmag-submitted__ptile-feed" data-theinmag-ctiles-strip aria-hidden="true">
      {%- for i in (1..section.settings.gallery_count) -%}
        <span class="theinmag-submitted__gcard theinmag-submitted__gcard--skeleton">
          <span class="theinmag-submitted__gcard-img"></span>
          <span class="theinmag-submitted__gcard-cap"></span>
        </span>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </span>
    <span class="theinmag-submitted__ptile-fade" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  </a>

  {%- comment -%} MEMBERSHIP tile - image + hover swap, from-price headline, features {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign m_main = ''
    if section.settings.membership_image
      assign m_main = section.settings.membership_image | image_url: width: 900
    elsif section.settings.membership_image_fallback != blank
      assign m_main = section.settings.membership_image_fallback | asset_url
    endif
    assign m_hover = ''
    if section.settings.membership_hover
      assign m_hover = section.settings.membership_hover | image_url: width: 900
    elsif section.settings.membership_hover_fallback != blank
      assign m_hover = section.settings.membership_hover_fallback | asset_url
    endif
  -%}
  <a class="theinmag-submitted__ptile theinmag-submitted__ptile--membership" href="{{ section.settings.membership_link }}">
    <span class="theinmag-submitted__ptile-bar theinmag-submitted__ptile-bar--membership">
      <span class="theinmag-submitted__ptile-barname">{{ section.settings.membership_name }}</span>
      <span class="theinmag-submitted__ptile-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </span>
    </span>
    <span class="theinmag-submitted__mbody">
      <span class="theinmag-submitted__mmedia">
        {%- if m_main != blank -%}<img class="theinmag-submitted__mimg theinmag-submitted__mimg--main" src="{{ m_main }}" alt="{{ section.settings.membership_image_alt | escape }}" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}
        {%- if m_hover != blank -%}<img class="theinmag-submitted__mimg theinmag-submitted__mimg--hover" src="{{ m_hover }}" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}
      </span>
      <span class="theinmag-submitted__mheadline">{{ section.settings.membership_headline }}</span>
      <span class="theinmag-submitted__mfeatures">
        {%- for n in (1..4) -%}
          {%- assign fkey = 'membership_feature_' | append: n -%}
          {%- assign feat = section.settings[fkey] -%}
          {%- if feat != blank -%}
            <span class="theinmag-submitted__mfeature">
              <svg class="theinmag-submitted__mtick" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 10.5l3.5 3.5L16 5.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
              <span>{{ feat }}</span>
            </span>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </span>
      {%- comment -%} Real reviews, straight from Judge.me {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- assign jm_reviews = shop.metafields.judgeme.reviews_grid.value.all_reviews.reviews -%}
      {%- if jm_reviews and section.settings.membership_review_count > 0 -%}
        <span class="theinmag-submitted__mreviews">
          {%- assign rev_shown = 0 -%}
          {%- for rev in jm_reviews -%}
            {%- if rev_shown >= section.settings.membership_review_count -%}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
            {%- assign rbody = rev.body | strip -%}
            {%- if rev.rating == 5 and rbody != blank and rbody.size < 150 -%}
              <span class="theinmag-submitted__mreview">
                <span class="theinmag-submitted__mstars" aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span>
                <span class="theinmag-submitted__mquote">{{ rbody }}</span>
                <span class="theinmag-submitted__mauthor">{%- if rev.reviewer_name != blank and rev.is_anonymous_reviewer != true -%}{{ rev.reviewer_name }}{%- else -%}A happy reader{%- endif -%}</span>
              </span>
              {%- assign rev_shown = rev_shown | plus: 1 -%}
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
        </span>
      {%- endif -%}
      <span class="theinmag-submitted__mchar" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="theinmag-submitted__mchar-slot" data-theinmag-pool-character></span>
      </span>
    </span>
  </a>

</div>

<script>
  /* Live gallery tile: pull REAL kid creations from the same feed the gallery
     and submitted pages use, and populate the clipped strip. Self-contained and
     scoped to this snippet's own data-theinmag-ctiles-* hooks, so it shares
     nothing with the submitted section's script and cannot break that page.
     Mirrors the submitted section's fetch-and-render behaviour exactly. */
  (function () {
    var gtile = document.querySelector('[data-theinmag-ctiles-gallery]');
    var strip = document.querySelector('[data-theinmag-ctiles-strip]');
    if (!gtile || !strip) return;
    if (gtile.__ctilesGalleryInit) return;
    gtile.__ctilesGalleryInit = true;

    var count = parseInt(gtile.getAttribute('data-gallery-count'), 10) || 4;
    var sources = [gtile.getAttribute('data-gallery-json'), gtile.getAttribute('data-gallery-json-fallback')].filter(Boolean);

    function sized(url, w) { return url ? url + (url.indexOf('?') >= 0 ? '&' : '?') + 'width=' + w : ''; }
    function titleCase(s) { return (s || '').replace(/\w\S*/g, function (t) { return t.charAt(0).toUpperCase() + t.substr(1).toLowerCase(); }); }
    function attribution(c) {
      var name = titleCase(c.first_name || '');
      if (c.last_initial) name += ' ' + String(c.last_initial).toUpperCase() + '.';
      var loc = titleCase(c.town || '');
      if (c.state) loc += ' ' + String(c.state).toUpperCase();
      var out = name;
      if (loc) out += (out ? ' | ' : '') + loc;
      if (c.age) out += ', age ' + c.age;
      return out;
    }

    function tryNext(i) {
      if (i >= sources.length) { strip.innerHTML = ''; return; }
      fetch(sources[i], { credentials: 'omit' })
        .then(function (r) { if (!r.ok) throw 0; return r.json(); })
        .then(function (data) {
          var list = ((data && data.creations) || []).filter(function (c) { return !c.is_text_only && c.images && c.images.length; });
          if (!list.length) throw 0;
          list.sort(function (a, b) { return (b.submitted_at || '').localeCompare(a.submitted_at || ''); });
          renderCards(list.slice(0, count));
        })
        .catch(function () { tryNext(i + 1); });
    }

    function renderCards(items) {
      strip.innerHTML = '';
      items.forEach(function (c) {
        var card = document.createElement('span');
        card.className = 'theinmag-submitted__gcard';
        var imgWrap = document.createElement('span');
        imgWrap.className = 'theinmag-submitted__gcard-img';
        var img = document.createElement('img');
        img.loading = 'lazy';
        img.decoding = 'async';
        img.src = sized(c.images[0], 480);
        img.alt = '';
        imgWrap.appendChild(img);
        var cap = document.createElement('span');
        cap.className = 'theinmag-submitted__gcard-cap';
        cap.textContent = attribution(c);
        card.appendChild(imgWrap);
        card.appendChild(cap);
        if (c.write_up) {
          var wu = document.createElement('span');
          wu.className = 'theinmag-submitted__gcard-writeup';
          wu.textContent = c.write_up;
          card.appendChild(wu);
        }
        strip.appendChild(card);
      });
    }

    tryNext(0);
  })();
</script>

<style>
  /* ================================================================
     theinmag-creativity-tiles
     Ported VERBATIM from sections/theinmag-submitted.liquid (Beat 2).
     Kept under the theinmag-submitted__ class names so the tiles render
     pixel-identical to /pages/submitted. This snippet is never rendered
     on the submitted page, so there is no double-definition.
     ================================================================ */

  /* ---- Beat 2: portrait "phone view" page-tiles ---- */

  .theinmag-submitted__tiles {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: clamp(16px, 3vw, 28px);
    padding: clamp(18px, 3vw, 26px) clamp(16px, 4vw, 48px) clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px);
  }

  /* On narrow screens the tiles become a swipeable row of phone previews.
     The row scrolls, which would clip each tile's drop shadow, so the
     padding here (and scroll-padding for snap) gives the shadow room. */
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .theinmag-submitted__tiles {
      justify-content: flex-start;
      overflow-x: auto;
      scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
      scroll-padding-inline: clamp(26px, 7vw, 36px);
      padding-left: clamp(26px, 7vw, 36px);
      padding-right: clamp(26px, 7vw, 36px);
      scrollbar-width: none;
    }
    .theinmag-submitted__tiles::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    .theinmag-submitted__ptile { scroll-snap-align: center; }
  }

  /* A portrait card that reads like the page opened on a phone. */
  .theinmag-submitted__ptile {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: clamp(240px, 62vw, 320px);
    aspect-ratio: 10 / 37;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl, 28px);
    overflow: hidden;
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(42, 31, 61, 0.2);
    transition: transform 0.22s ease, box-shadow 0.22s ease;
  }

  .theinmag-submitted__ptile:hover,
  .theinmag-submitted__ptile:focus-visible {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(42, 31, 61, 0.26);
    outline: none;
  }

  .theinmag-submitted__ptile:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--color-yellow, #F9C23C); outline-offset: 3px; }

  /* Gallery variant - dark inky-purple, echoing /pages/gallery. */
  .theinmag-submitted__ptile--gallery {
    background-color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy, #2A1F3D);
    color: #fff;
  }

  /* Cream banner, matching the gallery page's own header box. */
  .theinmag-submitted__ptile-bar {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    margin: clamp(12px, 2vw, 16px) clamp(12px, 2vw, 16px) clamp(8px, 1.4vw, 12px);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: clamp(9px, 1.6vw, 12px) clamp(10px, 1.8vw, 14px) clamp(9px, 1.6vw, 12px) clamp(14px, 2.4vw, 18px);
    background-color: var(--color-cream, #FBF6EA);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 20px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
  }

  .theinmag-submitted__ptile-barname {
    font-family: var(--font-heading, 'Post Regular', Georgia, serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(21px, 2.7vw, 27px);
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy, #2A1F3D);
  }

  .theinmag-submitted__ptile-arrow {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    width: 30px; height: 30px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background-color: var(--color-yellow, #F9C23C);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy, #2A1F3D);
    transition: transform 0.18s ease;
  }
  .theinmag-submitted__ptile-arrow svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }
  .theinmag-submitted__ptile:hover .theinmag-submitted__ptile-arrow,
  .theinmag-submitted__ptile:focus-visible .theinmag-submitted__ptile-arrow { transform: translateX(3px); }

  /* Single column of live submissions, clipped at the bottom so it reads as
     a scrollable feed - exactly like the gallery on a phone. */
  .theinmag-submitted__ptile-feed {
    flex: 1 1 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: clamp(10px, 1.6vw, 14px);
    padding: 0 clamp(12px, 2vw, 16px) clamp(14px, 2vw, 18px);
    overflow-y: auto;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
  }
  .theinmag-submitted__ptile-feed::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }

  .theinmag-submitted__gcard { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; flex: 0 0 auto; }

  /* Natural shape, like the real gallery - the whole creation, uncropped. */
  .theinmag-submitted__gcard-img {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm, 6px);
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }
  .theinmag-submitted__gcard-img img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }

  .theinmag-submitted__gcard-cap {
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: clamp(11px, 1.3vw, 13px);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: #fff;
    opacity: 0.92;
  }

  .theinmag-submitted__gcard-writeup {
    font-family: var(--font-body, 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(11px, 1.3vw, 13px);
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: #fff;
    opacity: 0.66;
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .theinmag-submitted__gcard--skeleton .theinmag-submitted__gcard-img {
    min-height: 190px;
    background-image: linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 30%, rgba(255,255,255,0.14) 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.06) 70%);
    background-size: 200% 100%;
    animation: theinmag-ctiles-shimmer 1.4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  .theinmag-submitted__gcard--skeleton .theinmag-submitted__gcard-cap {
    height: 12px; width: 70%; border-radius: 3px; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
  }

  @keyframes theinmag-ctiles-shimmer {
    0% { background-position: 200% 0; }
    100% { background-position: -200% 0; }
  }

  /* Bottom fade hints there is more to scroll, like a real feed. */
  .theinmag-submitted__ptile-fade {
    position: absolute;
    left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;
    height: clamp(40px, 8vw, 56px);
    background: linear-gradient(to top, var(--color-inky-purple-navy, #2A1F3D), rgba(42, 31, 61, 0));
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* ---- Competitions tile - bright, echoing /pages/competitions ---- */
  .theinmag-submitted__ptile--comps {
    background-color: var(--color-cream, #FBF6EA);
    color: var(--color-inky-purple-navy, #2A1F3D);
  }
  .theinmag-submitted__ptile-bar--comps { background-color: var(--color-peach, #FCDDB8); }
  .theinmag-submitted__ptile-fade--comps {
    background: linear-gradient(to top, var(--color-cream, #FBF6EA), rgba(251, 246, 234, 0));
  }
  .theinmag-submitted__ptile-feed--comps { gap: clamp(9px, 1.4vw, 12px); }

  /* Taller comp card - three stacked parts:
       top  = small logo beside the competition name
